xt":"또한","x":1579,"y":1647,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"\u0027if","x":1651,"y":1647,"width":32,"height":29}]},{"text":"와 \u0027function\u0027도 마찬가지이다. 따라서 충돌이 일어나게 되고 충돌은 앞에서 설명한 선형 조사법","words":[{"text":"와","x":401,"y":1704,"width":32,"height":32},{"text":"\u0027function\u0027도","x":443,"y":1704,"width":159,"height":29},{"text":"마찬가지이다.","x":614,"y":1701,"width":180,"height":34},{"text":"따라서","x":810,"y":1702,"width":84,"height":33},{"text":"충돌이","x":909,"y":1702,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"일어나게","x":1012,"y":1702,"width":115,"height":33},{"text":"되고","x":1142,"y":1703,"width":59,"height":31},{"text":"충돌은","x":1213,"y":1703,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"앞에서","x":1316,"y":1703,"width":86,"height":32},{"text":"설명한","x":1419,"y":1703,"width":90,"height":32},{"text":"선형","x":1521,"y":1703,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"조사법","x":1592,"y":1703,"width":88,"height":32}]},{"text":"으로 해결된다. 버것 조사는 원형으로 회전함을 기억해야 한다. 테이블의 마지막에 도달하면 다","words":[{"text":"으로","x":401,"y":1761,"width":60,"height":25},{"text":"해결된다.","x":473,"y":1759,"width":124,"height":32},{"text":"버것","x":614,"y":1758,"width":56,"height":32},{"text":"조사는","x":683,"y":1758,"width":87,"height":32},{"text":"원형으로","x":782,"y":1757,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"회전함을","x":910,"y":1757,"width":119,"height":32},{"text":"기억해야","x":1042,"y":1757,"width":118,"height":34},{"text":"한다.","x":1172,"y":1757,"width":66,"height":33},{"text":"테이블의","x":1256,"y":1758,"width":116,"height":32},{"text":"마지막에","x":1387,"y":1757,"width":117,"height":33},{"text":"도달하면","x":1520,"y":1759,"width":119,"height":31},{"text":"다","x":1654,"y":1759,"width":29,"height":32}]},{"text":"시 처음으로 간다. 다음은 거들이 삽입이 끝난 후의 테이블의 모습을 보여준다. [그림 14-13]은 한","words":[{"text":"시","x":402,"y":1814,"width":25,"height":33},{"text":"처음으로","x":444,"y":1814,"width":116,"height":33},{"text":"간다.","x":572,"y":1814,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"다음은","x":651,"y":1813,"width":88,"height":33},{"text":"거들이","x":750,"y":1812,"width":82,"height":33},{"text"